Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.69,0:00:08.03,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Oh, look, look! There's Joey's picture!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.69,0:00:08.03,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你们看，是乔伊的照片
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.24,0:00:09.57,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}This is so exciting!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.24,0:00:09.57,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}好兴奋喔
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.78,0:00:12.70,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You can spot someone who's never seen his plays.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.78,0:00:12.70,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你总是能知道 谁没看过他的表演
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.95,0:00:15.45,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Notice, no fear. No sense of impending doom.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.95,0:00:15.45,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}他们无畏无惧 不知道末日将至
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.66,0:00:17.87,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}The exclamation point scares me.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.66,0:00:17.87,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}标题上的惊叹号让我害怕
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.12,0:00:20.37,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}It's not just Freud, it's Freud!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.12,0:00:20.37,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}这不只是佛洛依德 是佛洛依德！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.13,0:00:23.50,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}ROSS: Shh. Magic is about to happen!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.13,0:00:23.50,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}魔法即将出现
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.46,0:00:26.13,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Well, Eva...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.46,0:00:26.13,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}伊娃…
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.92,0:00:30.01,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...we've done some excellent work here.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.92,0:00:30.01,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我们的进展很不错
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.30,0:00:33.01,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}And I would have to say...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.30,0:00:33.01,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我得说…
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.55,0:00:37.31,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...your problem is quite clear.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.55,0:00:37.31,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你的问题相当清楚
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.14,0:00:42.35,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}All you want is a dinkle
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.14,0:00:42.35,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你只想要个小小弟
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.73,0:00:45.61,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}What you envy's a schwang
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.73,0:00:45.61,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你羡慕他人的小弟
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.82,0:00:49.15,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}A thing through which you can tinkle
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.82,0:00:49.15,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}一个让你叮叮当的小东西
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.36,0:00:52.03,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}To play with or simply let hang
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.36,0:00:52.03,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}可以玩弄或晃在那
