Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.82,0:01:29.93,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}（主演：大卫·修蒙）
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.42,0:01:52.55,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I feel violated.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.42,0:01:52.55,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我觉得受到冒犯
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.34,0:01:56.47,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Did anybody else feel like peeling their skin off...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.34,0:01:56.47,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}有其他人感觉到 只想剥了自己的皮…
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.68,0:01:58.60,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...to have something else to do?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.68,0:01:58.60,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}好做点其他事情吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.06,0:01:59.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}（制片：塔德·史帝文斯）
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.27,0:02:00.31,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Ross, 10:00.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.27,0:02:00.31,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}罗斯，十点钟
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.56,0:02:02.35,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Is it? It feels like 2.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.56,0:02:02.35,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}是吗 感觉像凌晨两点了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.69,0:02:05.48,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}No, 10:00!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.69,0:02:05.48,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}- 不是啦，是十点钟 - 什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.73,0:02:07.22,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}（编剧：亚当·却斯  艾拉·安德里德）
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.44,0:02:11.32,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}There's a beautiful woman at 8, 9, 10:00!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.44,0:02:11.32,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}有个漂亮的女人 在八、九、十点钟方向
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.78,0:02:12.19,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}（导演：亚琳·史丹佛）
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.49,0:02:14.65,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}ROSS: Hello!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.49,0:02:14.65,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}哈罗
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.91,0:02:15.91,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}She's amazing!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.91,0:02:15.91,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}她太棒了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.12,0:02:19.74,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}She makes the women I dream about look like short, fat, bald men.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.12,0:02:19.74,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}让我梦想中的女性 都变成又矮又胖的秃头男性
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.95,0:02:22.66,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Go over to her. She's not with anyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.95,0:02:22.66,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}过去跟她说话啊 她又没有伴
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.87,0:02:24.71,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}And what would my opening line be?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.87,0:02:24.71,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我要用什么开场白？
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.96,0:02:25.96,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Excuse me...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.96,0:02:25.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}不好意思…
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.92,0:02:31.25,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Come on, she's a person. You can do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.92,0:02:31.25,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}别这样，她也是一个人 你办得到的
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.46,0:02:34.47,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Could she be more out of my league? Ross, back me up.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.46,0:02:34.47,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我根本配不上她 罗斯，你说对不对？
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.68,0:02:37.59,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}He could never get a woman like that in a million years.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.68,0:02:37.59,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}- 他这辈子永远都别想要把到那种美女 - 谢了，老兄
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.68,0:02:43.47,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}But you always see these beautiful women with these "nothing" guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.68,0:02:43.47,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}但是我们常看到很漂亮的女生 跟不怎么样的男生在一起
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.73,0:02:45.73,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You could be one of those guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.73,0:02:45.73,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你可以当那种男生啊
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.73,0:02:48.56,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- You could do that. - You think?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.73,0:02:48.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}- 可以啊 - 真的吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.81,0:02:49.81,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}RACHEL: Absolutely!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.81,0:02:49.81,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}绝对可以
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.02,0:02:52.53,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I can't believe I'm even considering this.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.02,0:02:52.53,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我不敢相信 我竟然还有这种念头
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.78,0:02:55.36,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- I'm very aware of my tongue. - Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.78,0:02:55.36,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}- 我一向谨言慎行 - 快去
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.61,0:02:56.82,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Here goes.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.61,0:02:56.82,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}来了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.08,0:03:03.20,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Yes?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.08,0:03:03.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}- 什么事？ - 你好
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.54,0:03:05.54,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Hi. Um... Ahem.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.54,0:03:05.54,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}嗨，唔
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.75,0:03:07.75,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Okay, next word would be...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.75,0:03:07.75,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}好，接下来要说…
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.96,0:03:09.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...uh, Chandler.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.96,0:03:09.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}钱德
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.17,0:03:12.09,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Chandler is my name and, uh...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.17,0:03:12.09,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}钱德是我的名字 嗯…
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.51,0:03:14.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Hi!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.51,0:03:14.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你好
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.47,0:03:17.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Yes, you said that.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.47,0:03:17.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你已经说过了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.14,0:03:21.10,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Yes! Yes, I did. But what I didn't say...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.14,0:03:21.10,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}没错，但我没说的是…
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.31,0:03:23.39,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}What I wanted to say was, uh...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.31,0:03:23.39,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我想说的是…
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.60,0:03:26.81,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...would you like to go out with me? Thank you. Good night.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.60,0:03:26.81,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你有空想和我一起出去约会吗？ 谢谢，晚安
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.48,0:03:28.69,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Chandler?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.48,0:03:28.69,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}钱德？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.27,0:03:32.27,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}PHOEBE: There he is!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.27,0:03:32.27,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}他来了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.48,0:03:35.57,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}ROSS: I didn't know you could dance! RACHEL: You were in a play!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.48,0:03:35.57,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}- 我不知道你会跳舞 - 你参与戏剧演出耶
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.78,0:03:37.24,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}What'd you think?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.78,0:03:37.24,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你们觉得怎样？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.16,0:03:41.28,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}ROSS: I didn't know you could dance! RACHEL: You were in a play!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.16,0:03:41.28,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}- 我不知道你会跳舞 - 你参与戏剧演出耶
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.49,0:03:44.16,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Come on, it wasn't that bad. I was the lead.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.49,0:03:44.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}别这样，没那么糟吧 我至少是主角
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.37,0:03:47.62,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}It was better than the troll thing. At least you got to see my head.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.37,0:03:47.62,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}比轮唱好吧 至少可以看到我的头
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.75,0:03:50.96,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}RACHEL: You're right. ROSS: We saw your head.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.75,0:03:50.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}- 没错 - 我们有看到你的头
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.17,0:03:52.71,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}She said yes! She said yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.17,0:03:52.71,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}她说好！她说好
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.92,0:03:53.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}MONICA: Wow!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.92,0:03:53.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}哇
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.13,0:03:56.51,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Awful play, man! Whoa!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.13,0:03:56.51,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}这部剧烂透了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.47,0:04:02.72,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Her name's Aurora. She's Italian and she pronounces my name "Chandler."
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.47,0:04:02.72,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}她叫做欧若拉，是意大利人 说我的名字时超好听的
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.81,0:04:07.93,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I like that better. The usher gave me this to give to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.81,0:04:07.93,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我喜欢那样的叫法 噢，引座员叫我把这个给你
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.14,0:04:11.23,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- What is it? - The Estelle Leonard Talent Agency.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.14,0:04:11.23,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}- 什么东西？ - 伊斯特·李奥纳德经纪公司
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.44,0:04:14.27,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}An agency left me its card. Maybe they wanna sign me!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.44,0:04:14.27,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}哇，有经纪公司给我名片 或许他们想跟我签约
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.48,0:04:15.65,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Based on this play?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.48,0:04:15.65,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}在看完今天的表演后？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.28,0:04:20.28,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Based on this play!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.28,0:04:20.28,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}在看完今天的表演后！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.54,0:04:27.99,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}（中央咖啡厅）
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.25,0:04:30.33,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Hey, kids!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.25,0:04:30.33,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}嘿，各位
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.54,0:04:31.54,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}ROSS: Hey, Chandler.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.54,0:04:31.54,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}嘿，钱德
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.75,0:04:35.17,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}No, because this line is passion, and this is just a line.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.75,0:04:35.17,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}不 这条线是热情 这一条只是线而已
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.50,0:04:39.22,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I've been here seven seconds, and you haven't asked me how my date went.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.50,0:04:39.22,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我不敢相信我已经来七秒钟了 却没有人问我约会的情况
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.26,0:04:42.89,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}How was your date, Chandler?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.26,0:04:42.89,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你的约会怎么样，钱德？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.10,0:04:44.35,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}It was unbelievable!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.10,0:04:44.35,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}无法置信
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.56,0:04:48.18,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I've never met anyone like her. She's had the most amazing life!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.56,0:04:48.18,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我没碰过像她这样的人 她的一生超精彩的
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.39,0:04:50.06,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}CHANDLER: She was in the Israeli army.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.39,0:04:50.06,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}她参加过以色列军队
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.27,0:04:52.35,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}None of the bullets hit the engine block...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.27,0:04:52.35,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}幸好没有子弹打到引擎
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.60,0:04:54.98,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...so we made it to the border.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.60,0:04:54.98,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我们才能逃到边境
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.19,0:04:57.11,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}But just barely and I...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.19,0:04:57.11,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}但也只是侥幸逃出，我…
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.19,0:05:02.11,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I've been talking about myself all night long. I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.19,0:05:02.11,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我整晚都在讲我的事 真的很抱歉
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.32,0:05:04.41,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}What about you? Tell me your stories.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.32,0:05:04.41,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}那你呢？ 告诉我你的故事
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.28,0:05:06.49,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}All right, once...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.28,0:05:06.49,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}好，有一次…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.74,0:05:09.45,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...once I got on the subway, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.74,0:05:09.45,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}有一次我去搭地铁
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.71,0:05:11.33,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}And it was at night...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.71,0:05:11.33,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}那时很晚了…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.58,0:05:14.21,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...and I rode it all the way to Brooklyn...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.58,0:05:14.21,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我一直坐到布鲁克林站…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.13,0:05:16.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...just for the hell of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.13,0:05:16.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}只为了好玩
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.75,0:05:20.34,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}We talked till 2. It was this perfect evening.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.75,0:05:20.34,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我们聊到两点 实在是完美的夜晚
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.47,0:05:22.51,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}More or less.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.47,0:05:22.51,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}多多少少啦
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.72,0:05:25.09,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Suddenly, we realized we were in Yemen.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.72,0:05:25.09,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}突然间 我们发现自己身处也门
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.51,0:05:27.10,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I'm sorry, so "we" is?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.51,0:05:27.10,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}抱歉，谁是我们…？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.97,0:05:29.22,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}"We" is me and Rick.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.97,0:05:29.22,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}就是我和瑞克
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.43,0:05:31.89,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- Who's Rick? - Who's Rick?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.43,0:05:31.89,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}- 谁是瑞克？ - 谁是瑞克？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.10,0:05:34.15,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}My husband.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.10,0:05:34.15,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我先生
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.40,0:05:35.48,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}ALL: Ooh.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.40,0:05:35.48,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}哦
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.61,0:05:38.98,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- Oh, so you're divorced? - No.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.61,0:05:38.98,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}- 噢，所以你离婚了？ - 没有
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.94,0:05:43.20,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I'm sorry. So you're widowed? Hopefully?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.94,0:05:43.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}抱歉，所以你在守寡吗？ 希望如此
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.45,0:05:45.87,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}No, I'm still married.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.45,0:05:45.87,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}不，我还是有夫之妇
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.66,0:05:51.95,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}So how would your husband feel about you sitting here with me...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.66,0:05:51.95,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}那你先生对于你在这里 有什么想法？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.46,0:05:54.62,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...sliding your foot so far up my leg...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.46,0:05:54.62,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}还把脚滑到我的脚上面…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.83,0:05:57.38,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...you can count the change in my pocket?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.83,0:05:57.38,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}连口袋里有多少零钱 都数得出来
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.09,0:06:00.34,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Don't worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.09,0:06:00.34,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}别担心
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.55,0:06:03.55,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I imagine he'd be okay with you because he's okay with Ethan.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.55,0:06:03.55,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我想说他应该不会介意 因为他也没有太介意伊森
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.09,0:06:07.51,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Ethan? There's an Ethan?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.09,0:06:07.51,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}伊森？谁是伊森？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.72,0:06:10.60,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Ethan is my...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.72,0:06:10.60,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}伊森是我的…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.02,0:06:12.06,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...boyfriend.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.02,0:06:12.06,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}男朋友
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.39,0:06:13.48,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}ALL: What?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.39,0:06:13.48,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}什么？!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.60,0:06:18.48,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}So, uh, what kind of relationship do you imagine us having...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.60,0:06:18.48,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}跟我解释一下 竟然你已经有丈夫跟男友了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.69,0:06:21.28,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...if you already have a husband and a boyfriend?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.69,0:06:21.28,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你希望我们会有什么样的关系？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.19,0:06:24.70,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I suppose, mainly sexual.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.19,0:06:24.70,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我想主要是性关系吧
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.03,0:06:27.07,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Huh.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.03,0:06:27.07,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}呵
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.33,0:06:29.95,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I'm sorry it didn't work out.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.33,0:06:29.95,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}很遗憾没有成功
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.33,0:06:33.45,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}What not work out? I'm seeing her again on Thursday.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.33,0:06:33.45,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}什么没有成功？ 我星期四还会再跟她见面
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.67,0:06:39.50,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Didn't you listen to the story?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.67,0:06:39.50,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你没有听到自己说的故事吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.71,0:06:42.42,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}How could you get involved with a woman like this?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.71,0:06:42.42,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}太诡异了，你怎么可以 跟这样的女人交往？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.67,0:06:46.09,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I had trouble with it at first, but I get all the good stuff.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.67,0:06:46.09,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我一开始也很难接受 但是想想其实百益无一害
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.30,0:06:49.72,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}All the fun, all the talking, all the sex...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.30,0:06:49.72,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}只要谈天说笑 还有性…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.93,0:06:51.60,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...and no responsibility.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.93,0:06:51.60,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}完全不用负责任
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.23,0:06:55.02,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}This is every guy's fantasy!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.23,0:06:55.02,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}这可是每个男人的梦想
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.23,0:06:57.77,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}That is not true. Ross, is this your fantasy?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.23,0:06:57.77,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}才不是，罗斯 这是你的梦想吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.02,0:06:59.73,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}No, of course not.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.02,0:06:59.73,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}当然不是
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.03,0:07:03.86,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Yeah. Yeah, it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.03,0:07:03.86,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}是，没错
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.61,0:07:08.28,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You'd go out with someone else who's going out with someone else?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.61,0:07:08.28,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}所以你们不介意 跟有其他伴侣的女性交往？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.57,0:07:09.62,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I couldn't.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.57,0:07:09.62,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我做不到
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.83,0:07:10.87,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Good for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.83,0:07:10.87,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}很好
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.16,0:07:13.33,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}When I'm with a woman, I need to know...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.16,0:07:13.33,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我和女性交往时 我必须知道…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.54,0:07:16.41,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...that I'm going out with more people than she is.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.54,0:07:16.41,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我交往的人 比她还多
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.96,0:07:18.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You know...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.96,0:07:18.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}一夫一妻
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.21,0:07:21.21,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...monogamy can be a tricky concept.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.21,0:07:21.21,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}确实值得商榷
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.42,0:07:22.75,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I mean, anthropologically...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.42,0:07:22.75,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}就人类学上的角度来说…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.67,0:07:27.68,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Fine. Now you'll never know.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.67,0:07:27.68,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}好吧，你们永远 都不会知道了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.93,0:07:29.51,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}We're kidding. Tell us.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.93,0:07:29.51,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我们只是开玩笑啦 说吧
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.72,0:07:31.35,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}MONICA: We wanna know. JOEY: Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.72,0:07:31.35,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}- 我们都想知道 - 说啦
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.56,0:07:35.35,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}All right. There's a theory put forth by Richard Leakey...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.56,0:07:35.35,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}好吧，理查李基 有一个理论…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.40,0:07:45.48,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Ta-da!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.40,0:07:45.48,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}塔-哒
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.61,0:07:49.66,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Are we greeting each other this way now? I like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.61,0:07:49.66,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我们以后都要用这样的方式 打招呼吗？我还挺喜欢的
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.33,0:07:52.99,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Look! I cleaned!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.33,0:07:52.99,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你们看，我打扫了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.20,0:07:55.45,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I did the windows. I did the floors.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.20,0:07:55.45,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我擦了窗户 地板
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.66,0:07:59.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I used all the attachments on the vacuum except for that round one.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.66,0:07:59.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我还用了吸尘器所有的接头 除了圆的那一个
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.21,0:08:00.63,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I don't know what it's for.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.21,0:08:00.63,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我不知道那是用来做什么的
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.88,0:08:03.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Nobody knows, and we're not supposed to ask.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.88,0:08:03.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}没有人知道 我们也不该问
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.25,0:08:05.46,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}RACHEL: What do you think?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.25,0:08:05.46,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你们觉得怎么样？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.71,0:08:08.42,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}CHANDLER: It's very clean. MONICA: Really, it looks great!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.71,0:08:08.42,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}- 很干净 - 真的，很棒
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.51,0:08:15.51,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Oh. Heh. I see you moved the green ottoman.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.51,0:08:15.51,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我看到你移动了绿色的垫椅
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.81,0:08:17.52,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}ROSS & PHOEBE: Uh-oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.81,0:08:17.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}啊哦
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.44,0:08:20.94,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}How did that happen?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.44,0:08:20.94,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}是怎么发生的？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.40,0:08:24.86,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I don't know. I thought it looked better there.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.40,0:08:24.86,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}不知道啊 我觉得放那边比较好看
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.11,0:08:28.40,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}And also, it's an extra seat around the coffee table.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.11,0:08:28.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}而且茶几旁边 也多一个座位
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.03,0:08:30.95,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Yeah, it's interesting.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.03,0:08:30.95,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}对，是蛮有趣的
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.49,0:08:34.62,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}But you know what? Just for fun...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.49,0:08:34.62,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}这样好了，只是好玩…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.12,0:08:38.58,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...let's see what it looked like in the old spot.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.12,0:08:38.58,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}看看放在原本的位置会如何
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.29,0:08:41.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Just to compare.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.29,0:08:41.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}只是比较一下
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.29,0:08:42.79,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Let's see. Ha!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.29,0:08:42.79,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}看一下
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.00,0:08:44.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Well, it looks good there too.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.00,0:08:44.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}嗯，放在这里 也很棒
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.42,0:08:47.46,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Let's leave it there for a while.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.42,0:08:47.46,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}先摆在这里吧
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.47,0:08:51.30,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I can't believe you tried to move the green ottoman.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.47,0:08:51.30,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}真不敢相信你试着 搬动那个绿色的垫椅
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.43,0:08:54.64,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Thank God you didn't fan out the magazines.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.43,0:08:54.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}幸好你没摊开杂志
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.85,0:08:56.72,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}She'll scratch your eyes out.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.85,0:08:56.72,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}不然她会把你的眼睛挖出来
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.97,0:08:58.81,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You guys, I am not that bad!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.97,0:08:58.81,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我没有那么糟糕吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.02,0:09:00.27,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Yeah, you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.02,0:09:00.27,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你有，摩妮卡
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.69,0:09:03.19,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Remember, I lived with you?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.69,0:09:03.19,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}还记得我跟你 住在一起过吗
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.44,0:09:04.86,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You were a little, you know...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.44,0:09:04.86,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你就是一副…
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.28,0:09:10.57,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}That is so unfair!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.28,0:09:10.57,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}这样说超不公平的
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.78,0:09:14.62,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}When we were kids, yours was the only Raggedy Ann doll that wasn't raggedy.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.78,0:09:14.62,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}拜托，我们小时候 你的破娃娃是唯一不破的
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.45,0:09:20.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Okay, so I'm responsible. I'm organized.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.45,0:09:20.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}好吧，我比较有责任心 有组织性
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.29,0:09:22.12,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}But, hey, I can be a kook!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.29,0:09:22.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}但我也能很懒散
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.50,0:09:26.59,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}All right, you madcap gal!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.50,0:09:26.59,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}好吧，懒女人
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.34,0:09:29.51,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Try to imagine this.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.34,0:09:29.51,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}想像这个情况
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.72,0:09:33.43,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}The phone bill arrives, but you don't pay it right away.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.72,0:09:33.43,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}电话帐单寄来了 但是你没有立刻付费
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.68,0:09:36.26,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- Why not? - Because you're a kook!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.68,0:09:36.26,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}- 为什么没有 - 因为你很懒散
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.39,0:09:41.14,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Instead, you wait until they send you a notice.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.39,0:09:41.14,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}所以你等到他们 再寄一张通知给你
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.06,0:09:43.27,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I could do that.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.06,0:09:43.27,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我做得到
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.48,0:09:47.44,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Okay, then you let me go grocery shopping...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.48,0:09:47.44,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}好 你让我去采购…
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.65,0:09:49.44,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...and I buy laundry detergent.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.65,0:09:49.44,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我买了洗衣精
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.78,0:09:53.11,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}But it's not the one with the easy-pour spout.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.78,0:09:53.11,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}但不是容易挤出来的那种
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.32,0:09:54.95,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Why would someone do that?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.32,0:09:54.95,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}怎么会有人这么做
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.24,0:09:59.29,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}One might wonder.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.24,0:09:59.29,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}有些人会这样想
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.58,0:10:02.25,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}A glass is on the table. There's no coaster.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.58,0:10:02.25,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}有人把杯子放在茶几上 没有杯垫
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.50,0:10:04.29,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}It's a cold drink. It's a hot day.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.50,0:10:04.29,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}是一杯冷饮 在大热天之下
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.00,0:10:09.30,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Beads of condensation are inching their way closer to the wood...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.00,0:10:09.30,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}小水珠逐渐逼近桌面…
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.55,0:10:10.59,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Stop it!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.55,0:10:10.59,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}不要说了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.30,0:10:15.59,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Oh, my God!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.30,0:10:15.59,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}天哪
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.05,0:10:17.97,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}It's true. Who am I?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.05,0:10:17.97,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}是真的，我是什么样的人？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.47,0:10:20.51,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Monica, you're Mom.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.47,0:10:20.51,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}摩妮卡，你是妈
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.86,0:10:29.94,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}JOEY: Uh-huh? Oh, my God!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.86,0:10:29.94,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我的天啊
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.94,0:10:32.19,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.94,0:10:32.19,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}好的
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.61,0:10:34.32,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Okay, I'll be there.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.61,0:10:34.32,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}好，我会去的
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.70,0:10:38.28,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}That was my agent.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.70,0:10:38.28,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}刚刚是我经纪人
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.24,0:10:45.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}My agent has just gotten me a job in the new Al Pacino movie!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.24,0:10:45.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我的经纪人帮我安排 在艾尔帕西诺的新片中演出
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.83,0:10:47.79,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}CHANDLER: Whoa! That's great!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.83,0:10:47.79,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}太棒了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.13,0:10:49.17,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}What's the part?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.13,0:10:49.17,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}什么角色？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.38,0:10:51.42,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Can you believe this? Al Pacino!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.38,0:10:51.42,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你们能相信吗？ 是艾尔帕西诺耶
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.67,0:10:53.51,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}This guy's why I became an actor.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.67,0:10:53.51,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}他是我成为演员的原因
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.72,0:10:56.05,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}"I'm out of order? You're out of order!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.72,0:10:56.05,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}〝我失控？ 你才失控
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.30,0:10:59.14,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}This whole courtroom's out of order!"
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.30,0:10:59.14,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}这整个法庭都失控了〞
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.18,0:11:01.85,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Seriously, what's the part?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.18,0:11:01.85,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}说真的，是什么角色？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.10,0:11:05.77,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}"Just when I thought I was out, they pull me back in!"
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.10,0:11:05.77,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}〝当我以为已经出局时 他们又把我拉回〞
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.10,0:11:09.15,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Come on. Seriously, Joey, what's the part?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.10,0:11:09.15,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}快点说啦，乔伊 是什么角色？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.11,0:11:12.69,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You're, you're... What?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.11,0:11:12.69,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你是…什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.28,0:11:17.66,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I'm his butt double, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.28,0:11:17.66,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我是他屁股的替身，好吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.08,0:11:24.62,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I play Al Pacino's butt.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.08,0:11:24.62,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我饰演艾尔帕西诺的屁股
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.87,0:11:30.13,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}All right? He goes into the shower, and then...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.87,0:11:30.13,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}好吗？他开始冲澡…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.38,0:11:31.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...I'm his butt.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.38,0:11:31.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我就演他的屁股
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.75,0:11:33.96,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Oh, my God!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.75,0:11:33.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}天啊
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.26,0:11:35.42,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Come on, you guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.26,0:11:35.42,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你们别这样
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.67,0:11:38.97,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}This is a real movie, and Al Pacino's in it and that's big!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.67,0:11:38.97,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}这是部艾尔·帕西诺主演 大制作的电影
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.22,0:11:40.64,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Oh, no, it's terrific.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.22,0:11:40.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}不，真的太棒了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.85,0:11:43.06,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}After all your years of struggling...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.85,0:11:43.06,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你努力了这么多年…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.27,0:11:46.48,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...you've finally been able to crack your way into show business.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.27,0:11:46.48,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}终于有机会 “挤”进娱乐圈了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.65,0:11:52.02,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Okay, fine. Make jokes, I don't care.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.65,0:11:52.02,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}好吧，你们尽量开玩笑 我才不在乎
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.27,0:11:53.69,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}This is a big break for me!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.27,0:11:53.69,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}这是我的一大突破
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.94,0:11:55.57,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You're right. It is.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.94,0:11:55.57,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你说得没错
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.78,0:11:59.61,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}So are you gonna invite us all to the big opening?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.78,0:11:59.61,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}那你要请我们去看 屁股首映会吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.50,0:12:14.21,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- I need to borrow some moisturizer. - For what?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.50,0:12:14.21,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}- 我需要借点润肤霜 - 干嘛用的？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.42,0:12:16.42,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}What do you think? Today's the big day!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.42,0:12:16.42,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你说呢？ 今天是大日子
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.97,0:12:19.80,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Okay, go into the bathroom. Use whatever you want.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.97,0:12:19.80,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}好，去厕所 想用什么都可以
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.01,0:12:22.72,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Just don't ever tell me what you did in there.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.01,0:12:22.72,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}只要别跟我说 你在里面做了什么
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.18,0:12:24.22,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}JOEY: Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.18,0:12:24.22,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}谢了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.18,0:12:29.27,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- Joey's mom's on the phone. - He's in the bathroom.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.18,0:12:29.27,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}- 乔伊的妈妈打来 - 他在厕所
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.48,0:12:32.94,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- You don't wanna go in there! - Come on, we're roommates.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.48,0:12:32.94,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}- 你不想进去的 - 拜托，我们是室友耶
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.65,0:12:37.15,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}My eyes! My eyes!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.65,0:12:37.15,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我的眼睛啊…！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.70,0:12:41.20,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}MONICA: I warned you.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.70,0:12:41.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我警告过你了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.45,0:12:43.24,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Who is being loud?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.45,0:12:43.24,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}是谁这么吵？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.45,0:12:45.45,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Oh, that would be Monica.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.45,0:12:45.45,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}噢，是摩妮卡
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.99,0:12:48.79,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Can I borrow some things? I wanna make Aurora breakfast.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.99,0:12:48.79,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}嘿，我可以借点东西吗？ 我想煮早餐给欧若拉吃
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.04,0:12:50.79,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You got the whole night, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.04,0:12:50.79,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}噢，你有整夜的时间能陪她？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.04,0:12:54.34,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Well, I only have 20 minutes until Ethan, so...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.04,0:12:54.34,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}对，我只有二十分钟 直到伊森…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.59,0:12:56.50,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Do I sense a bit of resentment?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.59,0:12:56.50,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}有人有点哀怨喔？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.76,0:12:59.84,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}No, no, no. No resentment. Believe me...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.76,0:12:59.84,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}不…没有哀怨 相信我…
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.09,0:13:02.18,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...it's worth it, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.09,0:13:02.18,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}真的很值得
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.39,0:13:04.60,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}In a relationship, you have these key moments...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.39,0:13:04.60,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}在感情关系中 总是有些特别难忘的时刻
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.80,0:13:07.26,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...you'll remember for the rest of your life.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.80,0:13:07.26,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}让你一辈子都会记得
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.52,0:13:10.73,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Well, every single second is like that with Aurora.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.52,0:13:10.73,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}跟欧若拉在一起的 每分每秒都像那样
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.98,0:13:13.48,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}And I've just wasted 35 of them talking to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.98,0:13:13.48,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}而我刚刚浪费了三十五秒的时间 跟你们说话
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.69,0:13:16.94,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}So, uh, Monica, can you help me with the door?
