Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.94,0:18:10.36,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}大家伙
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.53,0:18:14.74,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}It felt like a "big guy" moment.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.53,0:18:14.74,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我就是突然想这么说嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.70,0:18:16.74,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I got fired!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.70,0:18:16.74,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我被炒鱿鱼了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.99,0:18:19.91,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}They said I acted too much with it.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.99,0:18:19.91,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}他们说我太投入了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.75,0:18:24.58,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I told everybody about this.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.75,0:18:24.58,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我到处宣扬
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.79,0:18:26.75,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Everybody will be expecting to see me.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.79,0:18:26.75,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}现在大家都会到戏院 想看我演…
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.00,0:18:29.54,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You know what? No one will be able to tell.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.00,0:18:29.54,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}乔伊，没有人看得出来的
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.84,0:18:31.42,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}My mom will.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.84,0:18:31.42,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我妈会
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.34,0:18:35.43,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}There's something so sweet...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.34,0:18:35.43,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}这听起来很甜蜜…
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.68,0:18:37.89,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...and disturbing about that.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.68,0:18:37.89,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}却又很嗯心
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.18,0:18:42.10,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I've done nothing but crappy plays for six years...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.18,0:18:42.10,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}六年来，我一直在演烂戏…
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.35,0:18:45.35,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...and I finally get my shot, and I blow it!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.35,0:18:45.35,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}终于有机会了 却被我搞砸
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.56,0:18:47.31,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Maybe this wasn't your shot.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.56,0:18:47.31,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}或许这不是你的机会
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.52,0:18:52.07,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I think when it's your shot, you know it's your shot.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.52,0:18:52.07,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我觉得当机会真的来临 你就会知道
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.74,0:18:55.20,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Did it feel like your shot?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.74,0:18:55.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}感觉像是你的机会吗
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.61,0:18:59.20,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Hard to tell. I was naked.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.61,0:18:59.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}很难说，我当时光着身体
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.45,0:19:01.03,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I don't think this was your shot.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.45,0:19:01.03,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我不认为这是你的机会
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.24,0:19:03.54,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I don't even think you just get one shot.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.24,0:19:03.54,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我甚至不认为 你只会有一个机会
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.75,0:19:07.12,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I really believe big things are gonna happen for you. I do.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.75,0:19:07.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我真的相信 你会有一番作为
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.38,0:19:11.25,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You've gotta keep thinking about the day that some kid will go...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.38,0:19:11.25,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你要想说有一天 有个小孩会说…
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.46,0:19:15.13,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}..."I got the part! I'm gonna be Joey Tribbiani's ass!"
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.46,0:19:15.13,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}〝我拿到角色了 我要演乔伊·崔比亚尼的屁股〞
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.43,0:19:21.05,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You think? That's so nice.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.43,0:19:21.05,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}真的吗 你真贴心
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.43,0:19:23.85,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Oh, come here.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.43,0:19:23.85,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}噢，过来
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.40,0:19:29.98,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I'm sorry, Joey. I'm gonna go to bed, guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.40,0:19:29.98,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}抱歉，乔伊 我要去睡觉了，各位
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.23,0:19:31.27,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}ROSS: Good night.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.23,0:19:31.27,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}- 晚安 - 晚安，摩妮卡
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.65,0:19:33.86,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}RACHEL: You're gonna leave your shoes out here?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.65,0:19:33.86,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你要把你的鞋子留在这里吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.07,0:19:37.49,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Uh-huh.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.07,0:19:37.49,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}嗯-哼
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.03,0:19:42.33,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Really? Just casually strewn about...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.03,0:19:42.33,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}真的吗？就这样乱丢…
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.54,0:19:44.83,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...in that reckless, haphazard manner?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.54,0:19:44.83,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}完全都不整齐
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.75,0:19:50.46,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}It doesn't matter. I'll get them tomorrow. Or not!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.75,0:19:50.46,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}无所谓，我明天再收 或者是改天
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.17,0:19:53.38,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Whenever.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.17,0:19:53.38,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}随便啦
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.05,0:19:58.80,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}She is a kook.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.05,0:19:58.80,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}她真的很懒
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.52,0:20:16.61,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}If it bothers you that much, just go out and get the shoes.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.52,0:20:16.61,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}如果你这么心烦 就去把鞋子收好
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.20,0:20:20.78,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}No, don't do this!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.20,0:20:20.78,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}不，不要去
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.03,0:20:22.45,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}This is stupid!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.03,0:20:22.45,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}太蠢了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.70,0:20:25.79,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I don't have to prove anything. I'm gonna go get them.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.70,0:20:25.79,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我不需要证明任何事 我要去收
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.58,0:20:28.33,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}But then everyone will know.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.58,0:20:28.33,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}但是这样 大家都会知道
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.83,0:20:34.13,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Unless I get them, and then wake up really early and put them back.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.83,0:20:34.13,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}除非收好后，早上 早点起来再放回去
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.50,0:20:36.09,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I need help!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.50,0:20:36.09,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}谁来帮帮我啊
